<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-994b8fb2-7fff-5b5e-0fae-b52ec4b1e6b4" style=""><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Hello </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!Opportunity.Account}</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap;">,&nbsp;</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you for your time over our last phone call.&nbsp; As we discussed, the next step toward evaluating and purchasing properties from REI Nation is to verify how you have instructed us to Title your property.&nbsp; Your title choice may require further documentation, so please see the instruction below regarding title verification documents that we will need to receive prior to a sales contract being created and transmitted to you when the time comes.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Our records indicate that you have elected to Title this purchase in a </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap;"><u>{!Opportunity.Title_Name_Type__c},</u> </b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap;">with a purchase method of </span><font face="Signika, sans-serif"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><b><u>{!Opportunity.Purchase_Method__c}</u></b></span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap;"><u>.</u></b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> If this information is not correct please reply to this email with the Title entity type you have chosen.&nbsp; Keep in mind that your choices are Personal Name, LLC/Business Name or Trust.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Title Verification Documents</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">should be emailed to me as an attachment as soon as possible and the requirements are as follows:</span></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Personal Name requires: Legal Name accompanied by valid DL or Passport; SSN</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">LLC Business Name requires: Operating Agreement/Articles of Organization/EIN Letter</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Trust requires: Trust Abstract - Identifying the Trustees of the Trust</span></p></li></ul><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sincerely,&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!User.FirstName}</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 1.38;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!User.Sig2__c}</span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></div><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">REF: </span><span style="font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!Opportunity.Id}</span></p></span>]]></td>
